            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>This invention relates to a fire-resistant glazing, a precursor solution for forming an intumescent layer of a fire-resistant glazing, a method of manufacturing the fire-resistant glazing, and to the use of a fire-resistant glazing. More specifically, the present invention relates to a fire-resistant glazing which comprises a phase separation additive and to the manufacture and use thereof.</p>
